translate catalan strings:

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• (Explore) [[Address this vessel's statement directly.]{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Appeal to your shared humanity.] ''You speak about life and death and change and stagnation, but that isn't what any of this has been about.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to appeal to your shared humanity.] ''This has always just been about us. Two people forced to hurt each other again and again and again. But we don't have to hurt each other anymore.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to appeal to your shared humanity.] ''There can be love and conflict and beauty and ugliness between us without bringing the whole of reality into the picture.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to appeal to your shared humanity.] ''We're not the whole of reality. Why won't you see me the way I still see you? Why won't you see me for what I am?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to appeal to your shared humanity.] ''This doesn't have to be so big. You can come back down to my level. You can come back to me.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Reject her authority.] ''You've done nothing but lecture me since the minute I got here.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her authority.] ''You use all these pretentious metaphors and pretend you're making grand proclamations about who I am and who you are. But really you aren't saying much of anything.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her authority.] ''It doesn't even matter what I say to you, because you're just going to keep telling me your perspective like it's some universal truth.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her authority.] ''It was so much better when I was with your vessels. Even at their worst, they all still heard me.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her authority.] ''I don't know what you are, but you aren't any of them. You're just something wearing their skin.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Argue your independence.] ''You act as though the world can't exist without you. But I've existed without you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to argue your independence.] ''What are the woods, then? What is the cabin? What is the time we've spent apart if not me existing as myself?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to argue your independence.] ''I wouldn't be here if destroying you would leave all of reality a colorless blur.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to argue your independence.] ''I'd rather trust an ignorant soul who died trying to make things better than a god who'd let the wheel of suffering turn forever.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to argue your independence.] ''If I need to destroy you to build a better world, then I will.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to argue your independence.] ''Who said anything about destroying you? I just need to make you stop.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Reject her perspective.] ''I won't engage with violence.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her perspective.] ''It doesn't matter how I feel. Death, suffering, and oblivion shouldn't fall on others. If we are able to transcend death, then we are responsible for those it holds captive.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her perspective.] ''Suffering born in delusion is still suffering. It doesn't matter what we are now. We hurt each other, and we shouldn't have done that. We cannot let a world be spun out of that pain.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her perspective.] ''You reject the suffering of material reality, and yet you cling to its framework for meaning. We can be better than this.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• [[Continue to reject her perspective.] ''You claim your destruction would steal meaning from existence, but if my actions can make existence worse, then there must be actions that make it better. Perfection implies finality, and nothing is final.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:591
    old "{i}• ''I get it. There's no need for us to keep fighting. I'll leave with you. I just don't know how.'' [[Stop the fight early and surrender.]{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:595
    old "{i}• ''It was beautiful.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:595
    old "{i}• ''It was meaningless. Neither of us could ever truly win.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:595
    old "{i}• ''It was unnecessary. We could have worked together to build something better.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:595
    old "{i}• ''We didn't have to hurt each other.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:595
    old "{i}• (Return){/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:865
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I remember the moment of my victory. As soon as you entered my domain I destroyed you.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:872
    old "{i}• ''We've both become better for what we've been through, haven't we?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:872
    old "{i}• ''Not all obstacles are equal. Can meaning not exist in the absence of cruelty and pain?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:872
    old "{i}• ''I fought you to protect others, not to better myself.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:872
    old "{i}• ''I refused to fight you because I rejected what you desired. Obstacles don't need to take the form of bloody fists.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1067
    old "{i}• ''You're right. Without desire, we have no need for relationships. We would all be alone.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1067
    old "{i}• ''Yes, without desire, we have no need for relationships — we would all be alone. But if we had no desires, would being alone be so bad?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1067
    old "{i}• ''You cannot use eating me to prove that you're right.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1067
    old "{i}• ''But my intentions do matter. I only freed you to save myself.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1067
    old "{i}• ''I didn't want to free you. You tricked me. I just wanted to not be eaten.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1365
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''The more we fought, the more you became an animal. I put you down then, and I will put you down now. The world doesn't need your savagery.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''But I don't want to dance.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''Without you there is no need for redemption.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''Would you have us fight forever?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''The dance was good, wasn't it?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''You speak as though change comes gently, but our transformations were born of destruction and violence.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''But without you, I never would have starved to begin with.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''Thank you for ending our misery.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''Thank you for saving us.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''I don't want to think of a world without you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1372
    old "{i}• ''Are you so sure of yourself that you think the world would stop without you?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1436
    old "{i}• ''I'm ready. I want to leave with you.'' [[Stop the fight early and surrender.]{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1436
    old "{i}• ''I won't leave with you. Not until you see things from my perspective.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1650
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''My thoughts alone were enough to reduce you into nothing.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1657
    old "{i}• ''I was blinded by emotion. We both know that.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1657
    old "{i}• ''I want that feeling back.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1657
    old "{i}• ''That feeling never left me.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1657
    old "{i}• ''I have no desire to hide, but the truth can be made better. If destroying you is what that takes... so be it.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1657
    old "{i}• ''I don't want to hide from the truth.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1881
    old "{i}• ''That wasn't a rejection of fear. You broke me to your will.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1881
    old "{i}• ''You wanted to make the world suffer. You act as if you're above it all, but you're not.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1881
    old "{i}• ''I'm not afraid anymore.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:1881
    old "{i}• ''Even if I'm not afraid now, the fear of others is real. We can't uphold the harm that everyone suffers just because we're beyond it.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2073
    old "{i}• ''Thank you for sharing yourself with me.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2073
    old "{i}• ''I don't need to share my heart with anyone.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2073
    old "{i}• ''I wish I could share my heart with you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2073
    old "{i}• ''You showed me your heart to break me. It was a terrible thing to see.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2073
    old "{i}• ''If that is what it takes to rid the world of suffering, I could bear the solitude.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2333
    old "{i}• [[Reject her perspective.] ''I won't engage with an argument that favors death and suffering.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2337
    old "{i}• ''The path is just a metaphor. I want to protect them.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2337
    old "{i}• ''I don't want to keep anyone still.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2337
    old "{i}• ''What does the path matter if it always ends?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2337
    old "{i}• ''They'll get over it. They'll see your end as a gift in time.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2337
    old "{i}• ''That would be torture.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2564
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I did rise far above you. And I am far above you still. I will destroy you now as I destroyed you then.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2564
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I didn't humble you. You humbled yourself. Just as you broke yourself upon me then, so will you break yourself upon me now.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2574
    old "{i}• ''It didn't last. It wasn't worth it''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2574
    old "{i}• ''If you hadn't snatched that body away, we would have killed each other. We were self-destructive.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2574
    old "{i}• ''It felt so good to finally win, even if it was going to cost me my life.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2574
    old "{i}• ''After everything you put me through, it felt good to watch you fall apart.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2574
    old "{i}• ''Even if the journey was agony, the end gave the struggle meaning.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2792
    old "{i}• ''But without redemption there can be no sin.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2792
    old "{i}• ''If I'd known what you were, I never would have freed you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2792
    old "{i}• ''And I would sacrifice everything to free you again.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2792
    old "{i}• ''I had to sacrifice myself. The entire world was at stake.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2792
    old "{i}• ''I was glad to end us together.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2978
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I saw every version of us across every reality, and not every reality had you drawing breath. Even then, I went on. The world doesn't need you.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2985
    old "{i}• ''To be everything at once is the same as being nothing at all. Why would either of us want that?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2985
    old "{i}• ''To contain everything is to contain every evil alongside every good. Can we not shed the confines of our old selves and create?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2985
    old "{i}• ''I couldn't understand you then, but I think I understand you now.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:2985
    old "{i}• ''You seemed in pain. I'm sorry for what I did to you, but it was the only thing I could do.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3315
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Even when you became a shadow of a god, one good shot was all it took to bring you crashing down.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3315
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Even when you became a shadow of a god, still you were bound to my will. I denied you apotheosis then, and I will deny you apotheosis now.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3315
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Even when you became a shadow of a god, still you were bound to my will. I unraveled you then, and there is nothing stopping me from unraveling you now.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''I still defy you now.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''We were so close to freedom.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''It was you who stopped us from escaping.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''I'm sorry for what I did to you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''We made each other worse.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''You ripped me open then. I was only returning the favor.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''I miss when that was you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''Submitting to you was a mistake. I would have destroyed you if I knew what you were.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3328
    old "{i}• ''You were consumed by your own ego.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3728
    old "{i}• ''If there are no endings, there are no limits. If there are no limits, then there is no difference between growth and decay.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3728
    old "{i}• ''I have already come so far. What more is there left for me to see?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3728
    old "{i}• ''With time, we could have been better.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3728
    old "{i}• ''But I stabbed you in the back and left both of us paralyzed. What potential was there to rise above?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3728
    old "{i}• ''But you betrayed me. What potential was left for either of us to rise above?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3975
    old "{i}• ''With time we could have been better.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3975
    old "{i}• ''I would have liked to see that.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3975
    old "{i}• ''But you were stuck. That was it.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3975
    old "{i}• ''But we were stuck. That was it.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3975
    old "{i}• ''If I had known what you really were, I wouldn't have been so quick to free you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:3975
    old "{i}• ''Of course I helped you. I didn't want us to hate each other.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4187
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Even when you reduced me to nothing, you could not rid yourself of me. But I was able to rid myself of you.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4187
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Even when you reduced me to nothing, you could not rid yourself of me. But I was able to rid myself of you. I didn't even need to kill you to break your spirit.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4197
    old "{i}• ''I am not my body, but I feel my body suffer.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4197
    old "{i}• ''I am not my body, but perhaps others are theirs.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4197
    old "{i}• ''I don't fear death. Not anymore.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4197
    old "{i}• ''But what am I, if I'm not a body?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4418
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I killed you while you tried to strangle me. And when you flooded me with tears I did not drown.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4418
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I killed you without a second thought. And when you returned to set us both ablaze, I remained while you burned away.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4428
    old "{i}• ''I'm okay lingering.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4428
    old "{i}• ''I don't want to linger.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4428
    old "{i}• ''I deserved what you did to me.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4632
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Of course I will be, because I destroyed you then.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''Curiosity comes second to doing the right thing.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''I still want to know what's out there.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''You were a part of me. I couldn't bring myself to hurt you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''I couldn't bring myself to hurt you then, but maybe I should have.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''I don't care about being whole. I just care about doing the right thing.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''I miss what it was like to be together. Can we go back to it?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4639
    old "{i}• ''I don't want to destroy you. I just want to do what's right.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4862
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''The first time we met I executed you without a second thought. And at the end of my confrontation with your spirit, I hurled you down a bottomless pit.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4862
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Even when you cut the signal to my body, I cleanly executed you. And when I was confronted with your spirit, I hurled you down a bottomless pit.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4872
    old "{i}• ''I helped you out of fear, and I'm not afraid of you anymore. That is why I resist you now.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4872
    old "{i}• ''I fear you now more than ever.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4872
    old "{i}• ''I was glad to set you free.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4872
    old "{i}• ''Can you say with certainty what shape a world without you will take?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4872
    old "{i}• ''I don't want that world to come to pass.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:4872
    old "{i}• ''You didn't give me much choice.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5133
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''When your spirit possessed my body, I excised you from my heart. And when you tried to take me with you, I left you to languish. There is nothing you can do to me that lasts.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''I wish I could leave with you now like we did then.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''I miss being so close to you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''Just because we're bound together doesn't mean I can't be whole without you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''That was terrible. I never want to be so close to anyone ever again.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''I never wanted to get pulled into you. I was only trying to save the world.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''I never wanted to get pulled into you. I just didn't like sharing a body with you. And you rewarded me with more of what I didn't like.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5140
    old "{i}• ''I'm sorry that had to end so violently.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5446
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''I sunk my blade in your heart because I didn't need you. I still don't need you.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''I was so glad to dance with you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''That was a mockery of a life we shared.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''I'm sorry I killed you. I didn't know what else I should do.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''What we shared there was agony, but it doesn't have to be like that. We can find a way to make things better.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''I'd never want to hold the world still. But is suffering the only alternative?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''I'd never want to hold the world still. It needs you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5453
    old "{i}• ''The only reason we weren't happy was because we couldn't forget. There's a version of that world worth living in.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5696
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''It was so easy to let you fall into the abyss. You needed me, but I've never needed you.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5696
    old "{i}{outlinecolor=4f1313}• ''Fear or not, I drove that blade into your heart, and I remained while you were taken away.''{/outlinecolor}{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''I was happy to leave with you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''Neither of us could have been free without the other.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''I was happy to watch the world with you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''You were okay with me dropping you into the abyss?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''I'm so sorry for killing you.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''No matter what we did, we kept trapping each other again, and again, and again.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''Death is more than fear. It is reality. Just because we can reject it, does not mean the world is free of it.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''I'm sorry for dropping you into the abyss.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''You speak as if I chose to follow you. You ripped my head from my body and made me watch us kill each other.''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''You denounce fear and yet you laud violence and strife as necessary and beautiful. Can there be courage without fear? And is courage not beautiful?''{/i}"
    new ""

    # game/scripts/special/felina/felina_fight_1.rpy:5706
    old "{i}• ''You're right. There's nothing for us here.''{/i}"
    new ""

